<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Hasta el horizonte</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/colors.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="fonts/typography.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="fonts/sizes.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/global.css" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="js/tailwind-config.js"></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main
      class="flex flex-col h-[1279px] items-start gap-12 pt-8 pb-16 px-[72px] relative bg-colors-neutros-blancoroto border border-solid border-black"
    >
      <header
        class="flex w-[1299px] h-[58px] items-center justify-between relative mr-[-1.00px]"
      >
        <nav
          class="flex w-32 items-center gap-6 relative"
          aria-label="Navegación principal"
        >
          <a href="#" aria-label="Inicio">
            <img
              class="relative w-[49.5px] h-[51.5px] ml-[-1.75px]"
              src="img/icon-2.svg"
              alt=""
            />
          </a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="Volver">
            <span class="relative w-[58px] h-[55px]">
              <img
                class="absolute w-[83.33%] h-[83.33%] top-[16.67%] left-[16.67%]"
                src="img/icon.svg"
                alt=""
              />
            </span>
          </a>
        </nav>
        <nav
          class="flex w-[135px] items-center gap-7 relative"
          aria-label="Cuenta de usuario"
        >
          <a href="#" aria-label="Perfil de usuario">
            <span
              class="relative w-[61px] h-[58px] bg-[#6f343a] rounded-[100px] overflow-hidden border border-solid border-[#a6a6a6]"
            >
              <img
                class="absolute w-[85.23%] h-[75.00%] top-[25.00%] left-[14.77%]"
                src="img/avatar-placeholder.svg"
                alt=""
              />
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="Cerrar sesión">
            <span class="relative w-[46px] h-[53px]">
              <img
                class="absolute w-[91.85%] h-[91.27%] top-[8.73%] left-[8.15%]"
                src="img/image.svg"
                alt=""
              />
            </span>
          </a>
        </nav>
      </header>
      <section
        class="flex w-[1299px] items-start gap-12 relative flex-[0_0_auto] mr-[-1.00px]"
        aria-labelledby="movie-title"
      >
        <figure
          class="flex flex-col w-[344px] h-[489px] items-center justify-center relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0px_8px_18px_#0000002e] [background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(227,227,227,1)_0%,rgba(227,227,227,1)_100%)]"
        >
          <img
            class="relative self-stretch w-full aspect-[0.68] object-cover"
            src="img/image-1.png"
            alt="Cartel de la película Hasta el horizonte"
          />
        </figure>
        <article class="flex flex-col w-[907px] items-start gap-5 relative">
          <h1
            id="movie-title"
            class="relative w-[907px] mt-[-1.00px] [font-family:'Nunito-SemiBold',Helvetica] font-semibold text-black text-[64px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
          >
            Hasta el horizonte
          </h1>
          <div
            class="flex w-[469px] items-center gap-6 relative flex-[0_0_auto]"
            aria-label="Clasificación y duración"
          >
            <span
              class="relative w-[105px] mt-[-1.00px] [font-family:'Lato-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-[#f05c01] text-[40px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
            >
              + 12
            </span>
            <span
              class="relative w-[340px] mt-[-1.00px] [font-family:'Lato-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-black text-[40px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
            >
              Duración: 150 min
            </span>
          </div>
          <p
            class="relative w-[907px] [font-family:'Lato-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-[#1f1f1f] text-[26px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
          >
            Tiempo después de su ruptura, Sara y Jackson se reencuentran unos
            días antes de la boda de un amigo en común que se casa en una isla
            remota. Juntos atraviesan el océano camino a la boda, pero cuando el
            piloto de la avioneta sufre un ataque al corazón, ellos deberán
            hacer lo imposible para mantener la avioneta en el aire.
          </p>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="flex flex-col w-[315px] h-[74px] items-center justify-center gap-0.5 relative bg-[#6f343a] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-solid border-[#a6a6a6]"
            aria-label="Comprar entradas para Hasta el horizonte"
          >
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-12 py-8 relative self-stretch w-full flex-[0_0_auto] mt-[-11.00px]"
            >
              <img
                class="absolute top-[calc(50.00%_-_16px)] left-[calc(50.00%_-_16px)] w-8 h-8 z-[2]"
                src="img/icon.png"
                alt=""
              />
              <img
                class="relative w-8 h-8 ml-[-7.50px] z-[1]"
                src="img/icon-3.svg"
                alt=""
              />
              <span
                class="relative flex items-center w-fit mt-[-2.00px] mr-[-6.50px] z-0 [-webkit-text-stroke:1px_#f5f2f0] [font-family:'Lato-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-[#f5f2f0] text-2xl tracking-[0] leading-8 whitespace-nowrap"
              >
                Comprar Entradas
              </span>
            </span>
          </button>
        </article>
      </section>
      <section
        class="flex w-[1299px] items-start gap-[99px] relative flex-[0_0_auto] mr-[-1.00px]"
        aria-label="Información adicional de la película"
      >
        <section
          class="flex flex-col w-[640px] items-start gap-6 relative"
          aria-labelledby="cast-title"
        >
          <h2
            id="cast-title"
            class="relative w-[167px] h-[51px] mt-[-1.00px] [font-family:'Nunito-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-black text-[40px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
          >
            Reparto
          </h2>
          <div
            class="flex w-[640px] h-[378px] items-start gap-2 px-4 py-2 relative"
            aria-label="Información del reparto"
          >
            <article
              class="flex-1 grow bg-[#a9474f] overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-start gap-2.5 relative self-stretch rounded-[var(--shape-corner-extra-large)]"
            >
              <div class="relative flex-1 self-stretch w-full grow">
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col w-full h-full items-start justify-end gap-1 p-4 relative bg-blend-multiply [background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(0,0,0,0.5)_100%)]"
                >
                  <span
                    class="relative flex items-end w-fit font-m3-title-medium font-[number:var(--m3-title-medium-font-weight)] text-m-3refneutralneutral-100 text-[length:var(--m3-title-medium-font-size)] tracking-[var(--m3-title-medium-letter-spacing)] leading-[var(--m3-title-medium-line-height)] whitespace-nowrap [font-style:var(--m3-title-medium-font-style)]"
                  >
                    Label
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <aside
              class="w-14 bg-[#6f343a] flex flex-col items-start gap-2.5 relative self-stretch rounded-[var(--shape-corner-extra-large)]"
              aria-label="Más información del reparto"
            ></aside>
          </div>
          <p
            class="relative w-[241px] h-[47px] [font-family:'Inter-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-black text-2xl tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
          >
            Rol de la parsona
          </p>
        </section>
        <section
          class="flex flex-col w-[560px] items-start gap-6 relative"
          aria-labelledby="awards-title"
        >
          <h2
            id="awards-title"
            class="relative w-[315px] h-[53px] mt-[-1.00px] [font-family:'Nunito-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-black text-[40px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
          >
            Premios
          </h2>
          <p
            class="relative w-[560px] [font-family:'Lato-Regular',Helvetica] font-normal text-black text-[26px] tracking-[0] leading-[normal]"
          >
            Lamentablemente no ha sido nominada ni premiada
          </p>
        </section>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
